## 🎯 Supported Vulnerability Types

| Vulnerability | Detection Method |
|--------------|-----------------|
| Reentrancy | Static + Symbolic + Debate |
| Integer Overflow | Symbolic Execution |
| Access Control | Pattern Matching + AI |
| Oracle Manipulation | Exploit Chain Analysis |
| Flash Loan Attacks | Historical Pattern Learning |
| MEV Attacks | Transaction Simulation |

